---
title: Button Event Counter - FreeRTOS Semaphores
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant BTN as Button Task (producer)
    participant PS as Press Semaphore
    participant LS as Long-Press Semaphore
    participant CNT as Counter Task (consumer)
    participant LED as LEDs

    loop every 10 ms
        BTN->>BTN: PressDetector_Update()
        alt press edge
            BTN->>PS: xSemaphoreGive()
        else long-press
            BTN->>LS: xSemaphoreGive()
        end
    end

    loop forever
        CNT->>PS: xSemaphoreTake(timeout 10 ms)
        alt taken
            CNT->>CNT: press -> increment
        end
        CNT->>LS: xSemaphoreTake(timeout 0)
        alt taken
            CNT->>CNT: long-press -> reset
        end
        CNT->>LED: CounterDisplay_Show(pressed, count)
    end